Soroban Verify — authors
========================

The public repository begins at one synthesized commit, so `git log` there records none of the work
that produced it. This file does.

Contributors to the internal history this tree was exported from, alphabetically:

  Jia Chen
  Lily Hu
  Sander Heng
  Song Bai
  Teki Yang

Dependency updates in that history were also authored by Dependabot.

Apache-2.0 requires no attribution beyond the notices in LICENSE and NOTICE. This file exists because
the squash discarded thirteen contributor identities, and a one-line record is the whole remedy.

Contributors from here on are in the commit history, where they belong.
